{"id":372754,"imdb":"tt5526028","en":"Dou kyu sei – Classmates","orig":"同級生","ar":null,"tag":"Sincerely, Slowly, Falling in Love.","ov":"Rihito Sajo, an honor student with a perfect score on the entrance exam and Hikaru Kusakabe, in a band and popular among girls, would have never crossed paths. Until one day they started talking at the practice for their school’s upcoming chorus festival. After school, the two meet regularly, as Hikaru helps Rihito to improve his singing skills. While they listen to each other’s voice and harmonize, their hearts start to beat together.","rd":"2016-02-20","rt":61,"g":[10749,16],"lang":"ja","budget":0,"revenue":1397526,"companies":[{"n":"A-1 Pictures","logo":"/xV5tPYKZhP2Ko9dOh5A3FahuKsx.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Aniplex","logo":"/rDYExnBV61jGQnkhVVrPN4Yl7O1.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"HALF H･P STUDIO","logo":"/kAsLr1tqACZk9o8A3Lj52851oVw.png","c":"JP"}],"countries":["JP"],"langs":["Japanese"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"JP","d":"2016-02-20"},{"c":"US","d":"2016-05-06"},{"c":"TW","d":"2016-05-20"},{"c":"AU","d":"2016-09-20"}],"dir":["Shoko Nakamura"],"prod":["Shizuka Kurosaki"],"wri":["Asumiko Nakamura"],"mus":["Kotaro Oshio"],"dop":["Yukiko Nagase"],"cast":[{"n":"Kenji Nojima","ch":"Rihito Sajo (voice)","p":"/nRSPVjDkdpnrQabnK5mENH118zN.jpg"},{"n":"Hiroshi Kamiya","ch":"Hikaru Kusakabe (voice)","p":"/5aAAOlQ2hW5EqEQOzk4UeroxcTN.jpg"},{"n":"Hideo Ishikawa","ch":"Manabu Hara (voice)","p":"/gEjEDNGt3CHsyzFQdNqewZVbh0.jpg"},{"n":"Yurino","ch":"Mikipon (voice)","p":null}]}